1
00:00:01,292 --> 00:00:03,481
NozyWallet is a shielded-only

2
00:00:03,481 --> 00:00:04,462
Zcash wallet.

3
00:00:04,462 --> 00:00:06,348
Here's how to install it,

4
00:00:06,348 --> 00:00:07,707
receive, and send.

5
00:00:09,113 --> 00:00:10,981
Add NozyWallet from the Chrome

6
00:00:10,981 --> 00:00:12,787
Web Store, or grab the latest

7
00:00:12,787 --> 00:00:13,908
release on GitHub.

8
00:00:15,314 --> 00:00:17,229
Open it and pick NozyWallet

9
00:00:17,229 --> 00:00:19,145
sync. Your keys stay in the

10
00:00:19,145 --> 00:00:21,060
extension. You can also use

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,479
your own Zebra node.

12
00:00:23,885 --> 00:00:26,018
Tap Create and set a password.

13
00:00:26,018 --> 00:00:27,796
It encrypts the wallet on

14
00:00:27,796 --> 00:00:28,649
