15
00:00:30,056 --> 00:00:32,527
Write your 24 words down offline.

16
00:00:32,527 --> 00:00:34,549
Nobody can recover them for

17
00:00:34,549 --> 00:00:36,496
you. Then confirm a few to

18
00:00:36,496 --> 00:00:37,170
continue.

19
00:00:38,577 --> 00:00:40,353
Your balance is split across

20
00:00:40,353 --> 00:00:41,938
