21
00:00:41,938 --> 00:00:42,826
Sapling pools.

22
00:00:44,233 --> 00:00:46,399
Tap Receive for your u1 unified

23
00:00:46,399 --> 00:00:48,705
address. There are no transparent

24
00:00:48,705 --> 00:00:49,962
