27
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:56,938
Our demo wallet is still empty.

28
00:00:58,345 --> 00:00:59,729
With NozyWallet sync,

29
00:00:59,729 --> 00:01:01,376
sends go through the Nozy

30
00:01:01,376 --> 00:01:03,419
