31
00:01:03,419 --> 00:01:04,540
Paste an address,

32
00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:05,594
enter an amount,

33
00:01:05,594 --> 00:01:07,374
and add a memo if you like.

34
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,376
Tap Review and Nozy builds

35
00:01:10,376 --> 00:01:12,034
the shielded transaction in

36
00:01:12,034 --> 00:01:12,832
your browser.

37
00:01:12,832 --> 00:01:14,182
Fund the wallet first,

38
00:01:14,182 --> 00:01:15,840
or there's nothing to send.

39
00:01:17,246 --> 00:01:19,013
Shielded transactions keep

40
00:01:19,013 --> 00:01:20,916
